{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1321607001:0":{"text":"There's a hole in the ice here. Could this be the place Dominique mentioned?","source_cn":"这里的冰面上就有一个洞，会不会是德米记忆中的地方呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1829831D14C7887C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321607002:1":{"text":"But... Chippy doesn't see any houses around.","source_cn":"可是，这附近好像没有房子啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8A342268F4D613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321607003:1":{"text":"The river water was cold... I remember now...","source_cn":"河水，好冷……我……想起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C2EEE1AB20D0B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321607004:0":{"text":"Thalia and I came here to play... The ice cracked, and I fell into the water... I could hardly hear Thalia's cries... Luckily, someone passed by and saved me...","source_cn":"我和佐娅，一起来这里玩……冰面碎了大洞，我掉进水里……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03287EB7309FBD10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321607005:0":{"text":"Mother didn't let us come back here again after that...","source_cn":"后来……母亲不允许，我和佐娅再来这里……","status":